{"id":"de_part","lemma":"départ","pos":"noun","rank":767,"glosses":["departure, start"],"ipa":"/de.paʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c3/Fr-d%C3%A9part.ogg/Fr-d%C3%A9part.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"départs"},"formAudio":{"départs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-d%C3%A9parts.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je veux juste un nouveau départ.","en":"I just want a fresh start.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"fair, just"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},null]},{"text":"Il le savait depuis le départ.","en":"He knew it all along.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to know","l":"savoir"},{"g":"since"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Qui a eu cette idée au départ ?","en":"Who came up with that idea in the first place?","words":[{"g":"who"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"idea"},{"g":"to the"},null]},{"text":"Ce n'est pas un mauvais départ.","en":"That's not a bad start.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad"},null]},{"text":"Le participant fit deux faux départs.","en":"The contestant made two false starts.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"to participate","l":"participer"},{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"false"},null]}]}